    "A page at %@ was opened in Safari during a sign-in. If signing in did not work, that is the address to report.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Seite auf %@ wurde während einer Anmeldung in Safari geöffnet. Falls die Anmeldung nicht geklappt hat, ist das die Adresse, die man melden sollte."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A page at %@ was opened in Safari during a sign-in. If signing in did not work, that is the address to report."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una página de %@ se abrió en Safari durante un inicio de sesión. Si el inicio de sesión no funcionó, esa es la dirección que conviene informar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une page de %@ s’est ouverte dans Safari pendant une connexion. Si la connexion n’a pas marché, c’est l’adresse à signaler."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uma página de %@ foi aberta no Safari durante um login. Se o login não funcionou, é esse o endereço a relatar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A rough answer is fine. Your phone's Screen Time knows, if you would rather look.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine ungefähre Antwort genügt. Die Bildschirmzeit deines Telefons weiss es, falls du lieber nachschaust."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
