    "Counted across the days Quiet was open. A day you did not open it counts for nothing either way — Quiet cannot see what any other app on this phone did with it.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gezählt über die Tage, an denen Quiet offen war. Ein Tag, an dem du es nicht geöffnet hast, zählt in keine Richtung — Quiet sieht nicht, was eine andere App auf diesem Telefon mit ihm gemacht hat."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Counted across the days Quiet was open. A day you did not open it counts for nothing either way — Quiet cannot see what any other app on this phone did with it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Contado a lo largo de los días en que Quiet estuvo abierto. Un día en que no lo abriste no cuenta ni a favor ni en contra — Quiet no ve lo que hizo con él ninguna otra app de este teléfono."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compté sur les jours où Quiet était ouvert. Un jour où tu ne l’as pas ouvert ne compte ni dans un sens ni dans l’autre — Quiet ne voit pas ce qu’une autre app de ce téléphone en a fait."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Contado ao longo dos dias em que o Quiet esteve aberto. Um dia em que você não abriu não conta para nenhum lado — o Quiet não vê o que qualquer outro app deste telefone fez com ele."
          }
        }
      }
    },
