    "If you carry it between your devices, three of those go into your own iCloud — the limit, the wait, and how much each device has spent today. Nothing else, nowhere else, and only while the switch above is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn du es auf deinen Geräten mitnimmst, gehen drei davon in deine eigene iCloud — das Limit, die Wartezeit und wie viel jedes Gerät heute verbraucht hat. Nichts sonst, nirgendwo sonst, und nur solange der Schalter oben an ist."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you carry it between your devices, three of those go into your own iCloud — the limit, the wait, and how much each device has spent today. Nothing else, nowhere else, and only while the switch above is on."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si lo llevas entre tus dispositivos, tres de ellos van a tu propio iCloud: el límite, la espera y cuánto ha gastado hoy cada dispositivo. Nada más, en ningún otro sitio, y solo mientras el interruptor de arriba esté activado."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si tu l’emportes d’un appareil à l’autre, trois d’entre elles vont dans ton propre iCloud : la limite, l’attente et ce que chaque appareil a dépensé aujourd’hui. Rien d’autre, nulle part ailleurs, et seulement tant que l’interrupteur ci-dessus est activé."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se você levar entre seus aparelhos, três delas vão para o seu próprio iCloud — o limite, a espera e quanto cada aparelho gastou hoje. Nada mais, em nenhum outro lugar, e só enquanto a chave acima estiver ligada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Instagram did not answer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instagram hat nicht geantwortet."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instagram did not answer."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instagram no respondió."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instagram n’a pas répondu."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Instagram não respondeu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Instagram fills the feed with posts from people you do not follow once it runs out of the ones you do. Off, you see them all. On, the feed stops where the people you chose stop.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instagram füllt den Feed mit Beiträgen von Leuten, denen du nicht folgst, sobald die von deinen Freunden ausgehen. Aus: Du siehst sie alle. An: Der Feed hört dort auf, wo deine Freunde aufhören."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instagram fills the feed with posts from people you do not follow once it runs out of the ones you do. Off, you see them all. On, the feed stops where the people you chose stop."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instagram llena el feed con publicaciones de gente a la que no sigues en cuanto se le acaban las de quienes sí sigues. Desactivado, las ves todas. Activado, el feed termina donde termina la gente que elegiste."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instagram remplit le fil avec des publications de gens que tu ne suis pas dès qu’il n’a plus celles de ceux que tu suis. Désactivé, tu les vois toutes. Activé, le fil s’arrête là où s’arrêtent les gens que tu as choisis."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Instagram enche o feed com publicações de gente que você não segue assim que acabam as de quem você segue. Desligado, você vê todas. Ligado, o feed para onde param as pessoas que você escolheu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Instagram on this phone": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Instagram auf diesem Gerät"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
