    "It changes nothing about your limit or your day. It is the number everything above is measured against, so it is worth it being the true one.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es ändert nichts an deinem Limit und nichts an deinem Tag. Es ist die Zahl, an der alles hier oben gemessen wird — also lohnt es sich, dass sie stimmt."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It changes nothing about your limit or your day. It is the number everything above is measured against, so it is worth it being the true one."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No cambia nada de tu límite ni de tu día. Es la cifra con la que se mide todo lo de arriba, así que vale la pena que sea la verdadera."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ça ne change rien à ta limite ni à ta journée. C’est le chiffre auquel tout ce qui précède est comparé, alors autant qu’il soit le bon."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Não muda nada no seu limite nem no seu dia. É o número com que tudo aqui em cima é comparado, então vale a pena que seja o verdadeiro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It changes nothing about your limit or your day. It is the number the chart is measured against, so it is worth it being the true one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es ändert nichts an deinem Limit und nichts an deinem Tag. Es ist die Zahl, an der die Grafik gemessen wird — also lohnt es sich, dass sie stimmt."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It changes nothing about your limit or your day. It is the number the chart is measured against, so it is worth it being the true one."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No cambia nada de tu límite ni de tu día. Es la cifra con la que se mide el gráfico, así que vale la pena que sea la verdadera."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ça ne change rien à ta limite ni à ta journée. C’est le chiffre auquel le graphique est comparé, alors autant qu’il soit le bon."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Não muda nada no seu limite nem no seu dia. É o número com que o gráfico é comparado, então vale a pena que seja o verdadeiro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
