            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notificações"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the chart, the dashed lines mark your limit and the day you started from. Either is left off when it sits so far above your days that drawing it would flatten them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In der Grafik markieren die gestrichelten Linien dein Limit und den Tag, von dem du losgegangen bist. Eine davon fehlt, wenn sie so weit über deinen Tagen liegt, dass sie diese platt zeichnen würde."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On the chart, the dashed lines mark your limit and the day you started from. Either is left off when it sits so far above your days that drawing it would flatten them."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En el gráfico, las líneas discontinuas marcan tu límite y el día del que partiste. Cualquiera de las dos se omite cuando queda tan por encima de tus días que dibujarla los aplanaría."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur le graphique, les lignes pointillées marquent ta limite et la journée d’où tu es parti. L’une ou l’autre est omise quand elle se situe si loin au-dessus de tes journées que la tracer les aplatirait."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No gráfico, as linhas tracejadas marcam o seu limite e o dia de onde você partiu. Qualquer uma delas fica de fora quando está tão acima dos seus dias que desenhá-la os achataria."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the chart, the upper dashed line is that day and the lower one is your limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In der Grafik ist die obere gestrichelte Linie dieser Tag, die untere ist dein Limit."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On the chart, the upper dashed line is that day and the lower one is your limit."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En el gráfico, la línea discontinua de arriba es ese día y la de abajo es tu límite."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sur le graphique, la ligne pointillée du haut est cette journée et celle du bas est ta limite."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No gráfico, a linha tracejada de cima é esse dia e a de baixo é o seu limite."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One in the morning after a day you used Quiet, one after a week, one after a month. It says how long you were on Instagram and how much less that is than the %@ a day you started from — nothing about the rest of your phone, which Quiet cannot see.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine am Morgen nach einem Tag mit Quiet, eine nach einer Woche, eine nach einem Monat. Sie sagt, wie lange du auf Instagram warst und wie viel weniger das ist als die %@ am Tag, von denen du losgegangen bist — nichts über den Rest deines Telefons, den Quiet nicht sieht."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One in the morning after a day you used Quiet, one after a week, one after a month. It says how long you were on Instagram and how much less that is than the %@ a day you started from — nothing about the rest of your phone, which Quiet cannot see."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una por la mañana después de un día con Quiet, una después de una semana, una después de un mes. Dice cuánto tiempo estuviste en Instagram y cuánto menos es eso que los %@ al día de los que partiste — nada sobre el resto de tu teléfono, que Quiet no ve."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une le matin après une journée avec Quiet, une après une semaine, une après un mois. Elle dit combien de temps tu as passé sur Instagram et de combien c’est moins que les %@ par jour d’où tu es parti — rien sur le reste de ton téléphone, que Quiet ne voit pas."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uma de manhã depois de um dia com o Quiet, uma depois de uma semana, uma depois de um mês. Ela diz quanto tempo você passou no Instagram e quanto isso é a menos do que os %@ por dia de onde você partiu — nada sobre o resto do seu telefone, que o Quiet não vê."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One reminder a day, at an hour you choose — and none at all on a day you have already been. It cannot say whether anything happened on Instagram; nothing outside Instagram's own app can. What it can do is give the checking an hour, so the rest of the day does not need one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Erinnerung am Tag, zu einer Uhrzeit, die du wählst — und keine an einem Tag, an dem du schon da warst. Ob auf Instagram etwas passiert ist, kann sie nicht sagen; das kann nichts ausserhalb von Instagrams eigener App. Was sie kann: dem Nachschauen eine Uhrzeit geben, damit der Rest des Tages keine braucht."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One reminder a day, at an hour you choose — and none at all on a day you have already been. It cannot say whether anything happened on Instagram; nothing outside Instagram's own app can. What it can do is give the checking an hour, so the rest of the day does not need one."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un recordatorio al día, a la hora que elijas — y ninguno los días en que ya has estado. No puede decir si ha pasado algo en Instagram; nada fuera de la propia app de Instagram puede. Lo que sí puede hacer es darle una hora a la comprobación, para que el resto del día no necesite ninguna."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un rappel par jour, à une heure que tu choisis — et aucun un jour où tu es déjà venu. Il ne peut pas dire s’il s’est passé quelque chose sur Instagram ; rien en dehors de l’app d’Instagram ne le peut. Ce qu’il peut faire, c’est donner une heure au fait d’aller voir, pour que le reste de la journée n’en ait pas besoin."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um lembrete por dia, na hora que você escolher — e nenhum num dia em que você já esteve. Ele não sabe dizer se aconteceu algo no Instagram; nada fora do próprio app do Instagram sabe. O que ele pode fazer é dar uma hora para a conferida, para que o resto do dia não precise de nenhuma."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only time with Instagram on screen counts, and only on days Quiet was open — a day you did not open it counts for nothing either way. Quiet cannot see what any other app on this phone did with it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es zählt nur Zeit, in der Instagram auf dem Bildschirm ist, und nur an Tagen, an denen Quiet offen war — ein Tag, an dem du es nicht geöffnet hast, zählt in keine Richtung. Quiet sieht nicht, was eine andere App auf diesem Telefon gemacht hat."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only time with Instagram on screen counts, and only on days Quiet was open — a day you did not open it counts for nothing either way. Quiet cannot see what any other app on this phone did with it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Solo cuenta el tiempo con Instagram en pantalla, y solo los días en que Quiet estuvo abierto — un día en que no lo abriste no cuenta ni a favor ni en contra. Quiet no ve lo que hizo con él ninguna otra app de este teléfono."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seul le temps avec Instagram à l’écran compte, et seulement les jours où Quiet était ouvert — un jour où tu ne l’as pas ouvert ne compte ni dans un sens ni dans l’autre. Quiet ne voit pas ce qu’une autre app de ce téléphone en a fait."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Só conta o tempo com o Instagram na tela, e só nos dias em que o Quiet esteve aberto — um dia em que você não abriu não conta para nenhum lado. O Quiet não vê o que qualquer outro app deste telefone fez com ele."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens this profile": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet dieses Profil"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
