            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quiet cannot save to this phone's keychain. Your limit will not survive closing the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet kann nicht in den Schlüsselbund dieses Telefons schreiben. Dein Limit überlebt das Schließen der App nicht."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet cannot save to this phone's keychain. Your limit will not survive closing the app."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet no puede guardar en el llavero de este teléfono. Tu límite no sobrevivirá al cierre de la app."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet ne peut pas écrire dans le trousseau de ce téléphone. Ta limite ne survivra pas à la fermeture de l’app."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Quiet não consegue gravar no Chaveiro deste telefone. Seu limite não sobreviverá ao fechar do app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quiet cannot see this for itself. It only ever sees its own screen — not the Instagram app, not any other app on this phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet kann das nicht selbst sehen. Es sieht immer nur seinen eigenen Bildschirm — nicht die Instagram-App und keine andere App auf diesem Telefon."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet cannot see this for itself. It only ever sees its own screen — not the Instagram app, not any other app on this phone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet no puede verlo por sí mismo. Solo ve su propia pantalla — no la app de Instagram, ni ninguna otra app de este teléfono."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet ne peut pas le voir de lui-même. Il ne voit jamais que son propre écran — pas l’app Instagram, pas une autre app de ce téléphone."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Quiet não consegue ver isso sozinho. Ele só vê a própria tela — não o app do Instagram, nem nenhum outro app deste telefone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quiet could not load %@ from its own bundle. This build is broken; reinstall it.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet konnte %@ nicht aus dem eigenen Bundle laden. Dieser Build ist kaputt; installiere ihn neu."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet could not load %@ from its own bundle. This build is broken; reinstall it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet no pudo cargar %@ desde su propio paquete. Esta versión está rota; reinstálala."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet n’a pas pu charger %@ depuis son propre bundle. Cette version est cassée ; réinstalle-la."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Quiet não conseguiu carregar %@ do próprio pacote. Esta versão está quebrada; reinstale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quiet does not know what your day was before this, so there is nothing yet to measure against. Saying so below starts it.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet weiss nicht, wie dein Tag vor alldem war, es gibt also noch nichts zum Vergleichen. Sag es unten, dann fängt es an."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet does not know what your day was before this, so there is nothing yet to measure against. Saying so below starts it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet no sabe cómo era tu día antes de esto, así que todavía no hay nada con lo que compararlo. Decirlo aquí abajo lo pone en marcha."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet ne sait pas ce qu’était ta journée avant tout ça, il n’y a donc encore rien à quoi comparer. Le dire ci-dessous le met en route."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Quiet não sabe como era o seu dia antes disso, então ainda não há nada com que comparar. Dizer aqui embaixo dá o começo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quiet does not know what your day was before this, so there is nothing yet to measure against. The gear above is where to say.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet weiss nicht, wie dein Tag vor alldem war, es gibt also noch nichts zum Vergleichen. Im Zahnrad oben kannst du es sagen."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet does not know what your day was before this, so there is nothing yet to measure against. The gear above is where to say."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet no sabe cómo era tu día antes de esto, así que todavía no hay nada con lo que compararlo. En el engranaje de arriba puedes decirlo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet ne sait pas ce qu’était ta journée avant tout ça, il n’y a donc encore rien à quoi comparer. C’est dans la roue dentée ci-dessus que ça se dit."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Quiet não sabe como era o seu dia antes disso, então ainda não há nada com que comparar. É na engrenagem lá em cima que se diz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quiet forgets everything %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet vergisst alles %@."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet forgets everything %@."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet lo olvida todo %@."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet oublie tout %@."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Quiet esquece tudo %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quiet has no account, no server of its own and no analytics. It stores eight things on this phone: your limit, today's total, the last time it saw, the day you set it up, whether you have asked it to forget, what your other devices have spent today, the day you said you started from, and how long each day since has been.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet hat kein Konto, keinen eigenen Server und keine Analyse. Es speichert acht Dinge auf diesem Telefon: dein Limit, die heutige Summe, die letzte Zeit, die es gesehen hat, den Tag, an dem du es eingerichtet hast, ob du um Vergessen gebeten hast, was deine anderen Geräte heute verbraucht haben, den Tag, von dem du losgegangen bist, und wie lang jeder Tag seither war."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet has no account, no server of its own and no analytics. It stores eight things on this phone: your limit, today's total, the last time it saw, the day you set it up, whether you have asked it to forget, what your other devices have spent today, the day you said you started from, and how long each day since has been."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet no tiene cuenta, ni servidor propio, ni analítica. Guarda ocho cosas en este teléfono: tu límite, el total de hoy, la última hora que vio, el día en que lo configuraste, si has pedido que olvide, lo que han gastado hoy tus otros dispositivos, el día del que dijiste que partías y cuánto ha durado cada día desde entonces."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet n’a pas de compte, pas de serveur à lui et pas d’analyse. Il garde huit choses sur ce téléphone : ta limite, le total du jour, la dernière heure qu’il a vue, le jour où tu l’as installé, si tu lui as demandé d’oublier, ce que tes autres appareils ont dépensé aujourd’hui, la journée d’où tu as dit être parti, et la durée de chaque journée depuis."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Quiet não tem conta, nem servidor próprio, nem análise. Ele guarda oito coisas neste telefone: seu limite, o total de hoje, a última hora que viu, o dia em que você o configurou, se você pediu para esquecer, o que seus outros aparelhos gastaram hoje, o dia de onde você disse ter partido, e quanto durou cada dia desde então."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quiet has no account, no server of its own and no analytics. It stores six things on this phone: your limit, today's total, the last time it saw, the day you set it up, whether you have asked it to forget, and what your other devices have spent today.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet hat kein Konto, keinen eigenen Server und keine Analyse. Es speichert sechs Dinge auf diesem Telefon: dein Limit, das heutige Total, die zuletzt gesehene Zeit, den Tag der Einrichtung, ob du ums Vergessen gebeten hast, und was deine anderen Geräte heute verbraucht haben."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet has no account, no server of its own and no analytics. It stores six things on this phone: your limit, today's total, the last time it saw, the day you set it up, whether you have asked it to forget, and what your other devices have spent today."
          }
        },
        "es": {
