          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quiet has not been able to find Instagram's own layout on the last few pages. Instagram has probably changed something. Reels and Explore are still closed — those are refused by address — but the tidying up around them may not be.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet hat auf den letzten Seiten Instagrams eigenes Layout nicht gefunden. Wahrscheinlich hat Instagram etwas geändert. Reels und Explore bleiben zu — die werden nach Adresse abgewiesen — aber das Aufräumen drumherum vielleicht nicht."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet has not been able to find Instagram's own layout on the last few pages. Instagram has probably changed something. Reels and Explore are still closed — those are refused by address — but the tidying up around them may not be."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet no ha encontrado el propio diseño de Instagram en las últimas páginas. Probablemente Instagram ha cambiado algo. Reels y Explorar siguen cerrados — esos se rechazan por dirección — pero puede que el orden a su alrededor no."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet n’a pas retrouvé la mise en page d’Instagram sur les dernières pages. Instagram a probablement changé quelque chose. Reels et Explorer restent fermés — ceux-là sont refusés par adresse — mais le rangement autour, peut-être pas."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Quiet não encontrou o layout do próprio Instagram nas últimas páginas. O Instagram provavelmente mudou alguma coisa. Reels e Explorar continuam fechados — esses são recusados por endereço — mas a arrumação em volta talvez não."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quiet is missing %@. Reinstall from a clean build.": {
