    "Quiet shows Instagram's own site, so it needs the network to show you anything. Nothing has been lost — your day and your limit are on this phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet zeigt Instagrams eigene Seite und braucht dafür Netz. Verloren ist nichts — dein Tag und dein Limit liegen auf diesem Telefon."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet shows Instagram's own site, so it needs the network to show you anything. Nothing has been lost — your day and your limit are on this phone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet muestra el propio sitio de Instagram, así que necesita red para mostrarte algo. No se ha perdido nada — tu día y tu límite están en este teléfono."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet affiche le site d’Instagram lui-même, il lui faut donc le réseau pour te montrer quoi que ce soit. Rien n’est perdu — ta journée et ta limite sont sur ce téléphone."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Quiet mostra o próprio site do Instagram, então precisa de rede para te mostrar qualquer coisa. Nada se perdeu — o seu dia e o seu limite estão neste telefone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
