    "Quiet's second lock did not load this time. Reels and Explore are still refused; there is one layer doing it rather than two.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiets zweites Schloss ist diesmal nicht geladen. Reels und Explore werden weiterhin abgewiesen; es tut das gerade eine Ebene statt zwei."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quiet's second lock did not load this time. Reels and Explore are still refused; there is one layer doing it rather than two."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El segundo cerrojo de Quiet no se cargó esta vez. Reels y Explorar siguen rechazados; lo hace una capa en lugar de dos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le deuxième verrou de Quiet ne s’est pas chargé cette fois. Reels et Explorer restent refusés ; c’est une seule couche qui le fait au lieu de deux."
          }
