            "value": "A saída"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is nothing to compare against yet. Say what your day used to be under The days behind you, and this can start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es gibt noch nichts zum Vergleichen. Sag unter „Die Tage hinter dir“, wie dein Tag früher war, dann kann das hier anfangen."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There is nothing to compare against yet. Say what your day used to be under The days behind you, and this can start."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Todavía no hay nada con lo que comparar. Di cómo era tu día en «Los días que dejas atrás» y esto podrá empezar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il n’y a encore rien à quoi comparer. Dis ce qu’était ta journée sous « Les jours derrière toi », et ça pourra commencer."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ainda não há nada com que comparar. Diga como era o seu dia em “Os dias que ficaram para trás”, e isto pode começar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This clears the Instagram session from this app. Your daily limit stays as it is.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das löscht die Instagram-Sitzung aus dieser App. Dein Tageslimit bleibt, wie es ist."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This clears the Instagram session from this app. Your daily limit stays as it is."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto borra la sesión de Instagram de esta app. Tu límite diario se queda como está."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ceci efface la session Instagram de cette app. Ta limite quotidienne reste telle quelle."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Isto apaga a sessão do Instagram deste app. O seu limite diário continua como está."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is not a limit and it does not restrict anything. It is the number the days behind you get measured against.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das ist kein Limit und schränkt nichts ein. Es ist die Zahl, an der die Tage hinter dir gemessen werden."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is not a limit and it does not restrict anything. It is the number the days behind you get measured against."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto no es un límite y no restringe nada. Es la cifra con la que se miden los días que dejas atrás."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce n’est pas une limite et ça ne restreint rien. C’est le chiffre auquel les jours derrière toi sont comparés."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Isto não é um limite e não restringe nada. É o número com que os dias que ficaram para trás são comparados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is your limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das ist dein Limit."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is your limit."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este es tu límite."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voici ta limite."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este é o seu limite."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This phone has notifications turned off for Quiet, so the note has nowhere to arrive. It can be switched on again in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auf diesem Telefon sind Mitteilungen für Quiet ausgeschaltet, die Notiz hat also keinen Ort, an dem sie ankommen kann. In den Einstellungen lässt sich das wieder einschalten."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This phone has notifications turned off for Quiet, so the note has nowhere to arrive. It can be switched on again in Settings."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este teléfono tiene las notificaciones de Quiet desactivadas, así que la nota no tiene dónde llegar. Se pueden volver a activar en Ajustes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce téléphone a les notifications désactivées pour Quiet, la note n’a donc nulle part où arriver. Ça se réactive dans Réglages."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este telefone está com as notificações do Quiet desligadas, então a nota não tem onde chegar. Dá para ligar de novo nos Ajustes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This phone has notifications turned off for Quiet, so the reminder has nowhere to arrive. It can be switched on again in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Telefon hat Mitteilungen für Quiet ausgeschaltet, die Erinnerung hätte also nirgendwo anzukommen. In den Einstellungen lässt sie sich wieder einschalten."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This phone has notifications turned off for Quiet, so the reminder has nowhere to arrive. It can be switched on again in Settings."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este teléfono tiene las notificaciones de Quiet desactivadas, así que el recordatorio no tiene dónde llegar. Se pueden volver a activar en Ajustes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce téléphone a les notifications désactivées pour Quiet, le rappel n’a donc nulle part où arriver. Ça se réactive dans Réglages."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este telefone está com as notificações do Quiet desligadas, então o lembrete não tem onde chegar. Dá para ligar de novo nos Ajustes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This phone is refusing to let Quiet write anything down. Your limit will not survive closing the app until that changes.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieses Telefon lässt Quiet nichts aufschreiben. Bis sich das ändert, überlebt dein Limit das Schließen der App nicht."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This phone is refusing to let Quiet write anything down. Your limit will not survive closing the app until that changes."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este teléfono no deja que Quiet anote nada. Hasta que eso cambie, tu límite no sobrevivirá al cierre de la app."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce téléphone refuse que Quiet note quoi que ce soit. Tant que ça ne change pas, ta limite ne survivra pas à la fermeture de l’app."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este telefone está impedindo o Quiet de anotar qualquer coisa. Até isso mudar, o seu limite não sobreviverá ao fechar do app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Those are gone on purpose, not missing. Tapping a Reel a friend sends you will say so rather than open it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die sind mit Absicht weg, nicht kaputt. Ein Reel, das dir jemand schickt, sagt beim Antippen genau das, statt sich zu öffnen."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Those are gone on purpose, not missing. Tapping a Reel a friend sends you will say so rather than open it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No faltan: no están a propósito. Tocar un Reel que te envíe alguien lo dirá en vez de abrirlo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ils sont partis exprès, ils ne manquent pas. Appuyer sur un Reel qu’un ami t’envoie le dira au lieu de l’ouvrir."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eles sumiram de propósito, não estão faltando. Tocar num Reel que um amigo te mandar vai dizer isso em vez de abrir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today: %@ so far, %@ under.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Heute: bisher %@, %@ darunter."
