            "value": "Tentar de novo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two quiet notices, at five minutes and at one. Turning them off does not add any time — the day ends at the same moment either way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zwei leise Hinweise, bei fünf Minuten und bei einer. Sie auszuschalten bringt keine Zeit — der Tag endet so oder so im selben Moment."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Two quiet notices, at five minutes and at one. Turning them off does not add any time — the day ends at the same moment either way."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dos avisos discretos, a los cinco minutos y a uno. Desactivarlos no añade tiempo — el día termina en el mismo momento de todos modos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deux avis discrets, à cinq minutes et à une. Les couper n’ajoute pas de temps — la journée se termine au même moment dans les deux cas."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dois avisos discretos, aos cinco minutos e ao um. Desligar não acrescenta tempo — o dia termina no mesmo momento de qualquer jeito."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type a name. Quiet searches for people and nothing else — no Explore, no hashtags, no places.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tippe einen Namen. Quiet sucht nach Menschen und sonst nichts — kein Explore, keine Hashtags, keine Orte."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Type a name. Quiet searches for people and nothing else — no Explore, no hashtags, no places."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Escribe un nombre. Quiet busca personas y nada más — sin Explorar, sin hashtags, sin lugares."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tape un nom. Quiet cherche des gens et rien d’autre — pas d’Explorer, pas de hashtags, pas de lieux."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Digite um nome. O Quiet procura pessoas e nada mais — sem Explorar, sem hashtags, sem lugares."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Until that day nothing changes. Changing your mind costs nothing and can be done at any time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bis dahin ändert sich nichts. Es sich anders zu überlegen kostet nichts und geht jederzeit."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Until that day nothing changes. Changing your mind costs nothing and can be done at any time."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hasta ese día no cambia nada. Cambiar de opinión no cuesta nada y se puede hacer en cualquier momento."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jusqu’à ce jour-là, rien ne change. Changer d’avis ne coûte rien et se fait à tout moment."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Até esse dia nada muda. Mudar de ideia não custa nada e pode ser feito a qualquer momento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
