    "You asked for %@ a day. Quiet opens again at %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast dir %@ am Tag vorgenommen. Quiet öffnet wieder um %@."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You asked for %@ a day. Quiet opens again at %@."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Te propusiste %@ al día. Quiet vuelve a abrirse a las %@."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu as demandé %@ par jour. Quiet rouvre à %@."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Você pediu %@ por dia. O Quiet abre de novo às %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can ask for less whenever you like. It takes effect at once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um weniger kannst du jederzeit bitten. Es gilt sofort."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can ask for less whenever you like. It takes effect at once."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puedes pedir menos cuando quieras. Surte efecto de inmediato."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu peux demander moins quand tu veux. Ça prend effet tout de suite."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Você pode pedir menos quando quiser. Vale na hora."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can ask for more once a week, and it starts the next day — never in the moment you want five more minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Um mehr kannst du einmal pro Woche bitten, und es beginnt am nächsten Tag — nie in dem Moment, in dem du fünf Minuten mehr willst."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can ask for more once a week, and it starts the next day — never in the moment you want five more minutes."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puedes pedir más una vez por semana, y empieza al día siguiente — nunca en el momento en que quieres cinco minutos más."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu peux demander plus une fois par semaine, et ça commence le lendemain — jamais au moment où tu veux cinq minutes de plus."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Você pode pedir mais uma vez por semana, e começa no dia seguinte — nunca no momento em que você quer mais cinco minutos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can shorten the wait once the wait is over, %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Wartezeit kannst du verkürzen, wenn die Wartezeit vorbei ist, %@."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can shorten the wait once the wait is over, %@."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puedes acortar la espera cuando la espera termine, %@."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu pourras raccourcir l’attente une fois l’attente finie, %@."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dá para encurtar a espera quando a espera acabar, %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You raised your limit less than a week ago. You can ask for more again %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast dein Limit vor weniger als einer Woche erhöht. Um mehr kannst du wieder %@ bitten."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You raised your limit less than a week ago. You can ask for more again %@."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Subiste tu límite hace menos de una semana. Puedes volver a pedir más %@."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu as relevé ta limite il y a moins d’une semaine. Tu pourras redemander plus %@."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Você aumentou seu limite há menos de uma semana. Pode pedir mais de novo %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You sign in on Instagram's own page. Your password never touches Quiet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du meldest dich auf Instagrams eigener Seite an. Dein Passwort berührt Quiet nie."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You sign in on Instagram's own page. Your password never touches Quiet."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inicias sesión en la propia página de Instagram. Tu contraseña nunca toca Quiet."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu te connectes sur la page d’Instagram elle-même. Ton mot de passe ne touche jamais Quiet."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Você entra na conta na própria página do Instagram. Sua senha nunca toca o Quiet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Instagram window is open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Instagram-Fenster ist offen."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your Instagram window is open."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu ventana a Instagram está abierta."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta fenêtre sur Instagram est ouverte."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sua janela para o Instagram está aberta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your feed, your stories, your messages, your profile. Everything else works the way it always did.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Feed, deine Stories, deine Nachrichten, dein Profil. Alles andere funktioniert wie immer."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your feed, your stories, your messages, your profile. Everything else works the way it always did."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu feed, tus historias, tus mensajes, tu perfil. Todo lo demás funciona como siempre."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton fil, tes stories, tes messages, ton profil. Tout le reste marche comme avant."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu feed, seus stories, suas mensagens, seu perfil. Todo o resto funciona como sempre funcionou."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your limit is kept in the keychain, which outlives the app. Deleting Quiet and installing it again does not reset it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Limit liegt im Schlüsselbund, der die App überlebt. Quiet zu löschen und neu zu installieren setzt es nicht zurück."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your limit is kept in the keychain, which outlives the app. Deleting Quiet and installing it again does not reset it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu límite se guarda en el llavero, que sobrevive a la app. Borrar Quiet y volver a instalarlo no lo reinicia."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta limite est gardée dans le trousseau, qui survit à l’app. Supprimer Quiet et le réinstaller ne la remet pas à zéro."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu limite fica no Chaveiro, que sobrevive ao app. Apagar o Quiet e instalar de novo não zera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your limit is kept outside the app. Deleting Quiet and installing it again does not reset it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Limit liegt außerhalb der App. Quiet zu löschen und neu zu installieren setzt es nicht zurück."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your limit is kept outside the app. Deleting Quiet and installing it again does not reset it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu límite se guarda fuera de la app. Borrar Quiet y volver a instalarlo no lo reinicia."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta limite est gardée en dehors de l’app. Supprimer Quiet et le réinstaller ne la remet pas à zéro."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu limite fica fora do app. Apagar o Quiet e instalar de novo não zera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your limit is now %@ a day.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Limit ist jetzt %@ am Tag."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your limit is now %@ a day."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu límite es ahora %@ al día."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta limite est maintenant de %@ par jour."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu limite agora é de %@ por dia."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your limit, your day and the wait are thrown away — after %@, not now. You can call it off at any time before then. Your Instagram sign-in is a separate thing and is not touched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Limit, dein Tag und die Wartezeit werden weggeworfen — nach %@, nicht jetzt. Bis dahin kannst du es jederzeit abblasen. Deine Instagram-Anmeldung ist etwas anderes und bleibt unberührt."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your limit, your day and the wait are thrown away — after %@, not now. You can call it off at any time before then. Your Instagram sign-in is a separate thing and is not touched."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu límite, tu día y la espera se tiran — después de %@, no ahora. Puedes cancelarlo en cualquier momento antes. Tu sesión de Instagram es otra cosa y no se toca."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta limite, ta journée et l’attente sont jetées — après %@, pas maintenant. Tu peux annuler à tout moment d’ici là. Ta connexion Instagram est autre chose et n’est pas touchée."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu limite, seu dia e a espera são jogados fora — depois de %@, não agora. Você pode cancelar a qualquer momento antes disso. Seu login do Instagram é outra coisa e não é tocado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your limit, your wait and today's total, kept in your own iCloud so a second device is not a second allowance. Nothing else is sent, and nobody but you can read it — not even us, because there is no us: Quiet has no server and no account. Switching this off takes the copy down again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Limit, deine Wartezeit und das heutige Total, abgelegt in deiner eigenen iCloud — damit ein zweites Gerät nicht ein zweites Kontingent ist. Mehr wird nicht gesendet, und niemand ausser dir kann es lesen: nicht einmal wir, denn es gibt kein wir. Quiet hat keinen Server und kein Konto. Ausschalten nimmt die Kopie wieder herunter."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your limit, your wait and today's total, kept in your own iCloud so a second device is not a second allowance. Nothing else is sent, and nobody but you can read it — not even us, because there is no us: Quiet has no server and no account. Switching this off takes the copy down again."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu límite, tu espera y el total de hoy, guardados en tu propio iCloud para que un segundo dispositivo no sea una segunda ración. No se envía nada más, y nadie salvo tú puede leerlo — ni siquiera nosotros, porque no hay nosotros: Quiet no tiene servidor ni cuenta. Desactivarlo retira la copia."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta limite, ton attente et le total du jour, gardés dans ton propre iCloud pour qu’un deuxième appareil ne soit pas une deuxième ration. Rien d’autre n’est envoyé, et personne d’autre que toi ne peut le lire — pas même nous, parce qu’il n’y a pas de nous : Quiet n’a ni serveur ni compte. Désactiver ceci retire la copie."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seu limite, sua espera e o total de hoje, guardados no seu próprio iCloud para que um segundo aparelho não seja uma segunda cota. Nada mais é enviado, e ninguém além de você pode ler — nem nós, porque não existe nós: o Quiet não tem servidor nem conta. Desligar isto retira a cópia."
          }
        }
      }
    },
